77d181f3c52c143f7b462ce.mp4?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully featured gore system has been created from the ground up to include support for broken bones, dismemberment, wound deformation, and procedurally generated gibs and limb caps. Major wounds and breaks are survivable, but you may not be very effective with a few limbs missing. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Melee Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/bd4a21b18b53532f3db4a5bda110d65c.poster.avif?t=1787805605\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/bd4a21b18b53532f3db4a5bda110d65c.webm?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/bd4a21b18b53532f3db4a5bda110d65c.mp4?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get up close and personal with your foes by bringing some melee weapons to the fight. Blunt, stab, sharp and push melee damage can all be used to bring an end to your enemies if you run out of bullets or feel like getting messy.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Time &amp; Weather System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/9e59bc7a265b78d267036365dfe67fa8.poster.avif?t=1787805605\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/9e59bc7a265b78d267036365dfe67fa8.webm?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/9e59bc7a265b78d267036365dfe67fa8.mp4?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features a dynamic time of day and weather system. Weather includes fog, rain, storms, overcast and more. Battle can take place from dusk through to dawn, just be prepared when night time hits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synchronised Ragdoll &amp; Launching System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/8a90d8af385b1c00a5bccf269e091a3b.poster.avif?t=1787805605\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/8a90d8af385b1c00a5bccf269e091a3b.webm?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/8a90d8af385b1c00a5bccf269e091a3b.mp4?t=1787805605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes synchronised ragdoll positions to enable characters to be launched by explosions, impacts, throws, falls and more. They can then get back up if they haven't been too badly injured and continue battle. Launched characters can even knock other characters over. Bowling anyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783550/extras/4d15b5961cf9d3fd72f3f4003981a936.avif?t=1787805605\" width=1370 height=300 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Obscurity: Unknown Threat is a horror shooter game where a team of soldiers must survive against a hidden foe. The game contains both conventional symmetrical FPS game modes as well as asymmetrical battles vs the Obscurity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><s